# Generated run artifacts.
#
# `evidence/` and `results/` are produced by this project's own commands
# (`npm run eval`, `npm run test:integration`, `npm run demo`, `npm run probe:*`)
# and are tied to the evaluator revision that wrote them. They are regenerated,
# never committed: `npm run recompute` re-verifies whatever the current code produced.
